Hello transfer student

272
00:24:40.040 --> 00:24:41.600
Why don't you switch seats with me?

273
00:24:41.600 --> 00:24:42.360
No, switch with me

274
00:24:42.360 --> 00:24:44.500
Switch with me, please

275
00:24:44.500 --> 00:24:46.640
You people are so shameless

276
00:24:46.640 --> 00:24:49.390
How can you ask for it for nothing?
The seat next to Jay

277
00:24:49.390 --> 00:24:50.460
transfer student

278
00:24:50.460 --> 00:24:51.820
Ignore them and switch with me

279
00:24:51.820 --> 00:24:54.760
As long as you are willing to trade with me
I'll buy you whatever you want

280
00:24:54.760 --> 00:24:56.440
No price limit

281
00:24:56.440 --> 00:24:57.220
How is it

282
00:24:57.220 --> 00:24:59.900
Jin Nali, you want to settle everything with money again?

283
00:24:59.900 --> 00:25:01.520
This is too unfair, right?

284
00:25:01.520 --> 00:25:03.610
Let's play fair. Let's play guessing games.

285
00:25:03.610 --> 00:25:05.710
If you don't win, you lose. Rock-paper-scissors.

286
00:25:05.710 --> 00:25:08.330
cloth…

287
00:25:08.330 --> 00:25:10.460
I don't lack anything

288
00:25:13.610 --> 00:25:14.960
Nali

289
00:25:14.960 --> 00:25:16.210
Where are you sitting now?

290
00:25:16.210 --> 00:25:17.120
Me?

291
00:25:17.120 --> 00:25:19.350
I sit in the middle of the classroom, in the second row

292
00:25:19.350 --> 00:25:22.640
Right in front of the lectern, I can hear it clearly
The content of the teacher’s lecture

293
00:25:22.640 --> 00:25:24.580
You can also see the blackboard clearly. The field of view is super good.

294
00:25:24.580 --> 00:25:25.500
ok

295
00:25:25.500 --> 00:25:26.560
Then I'll trade with you

296
00:25:26.560 --> 00:25:28.150
Yeah awesome

297
00:25:28.150 --> 00:25:28.960
What?

298
00:25:28.960 --> 00:25:30.500
Transfer student, are you good at studying?

299
00:25:30.500 --> 00:25:32.240
so disappointing

300
00:25:33.650 --> 00:25:36.350
Then I can go

301
00:25:43.660 --> 00:25:45.640
Tell me what you want

302
00:25:45.640 --> 00:25:47.280
Don't regret it when the time comes

303
00:25:49.130 --> 00:25:51.060
It seems you are really rich

304
00:25:52.440 --> 00:25:54.480
Then can you give me a building?

305
00:25:54.480 --> 00:25:55.470
what

306
00:25:57.030 --> 00:25:59.460
Forget it, you don't have to spend money on me

307
00:25:59.460 --> 00:26:01.510
Buy your own cosmetics

308
00:26:06.610 --> 00:26:08.080
I've been looking for you for a long time

309
00:26:08.080 --> 00:26:09.730
Let's go to dinner together

310
00:26:14.190 --> 00:26:15.130
Let's go

311
00:26:15.130 --> 00:26:16.330
I'm so hungry

